+
+            <h2 id="about-this-policy" class="font-heading text-2xl">About this policy</h2>
+            <p>
+              Most Australian small businesses (≤ A$3m turnover) are generally exempt from the
+              Privacy Act. We voluntarily follow the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs). This
+              document sets out how we handle personal information in line with the APPs.
+              <strong
+                >We review this policy at least annually and if our operations change (for example,
+                if we expand internationally or our annual turnover exceeds A$3 million).</strong
+              >
+            </p>
+
+            <h2 id="what-this-policy-covers" class="font-heading text-2xl">
