+              <li>How we use and disclose it</li>
+              <li>Overseas disclosures</li>
+              <li>Security and retention</li>
+              <li>Your privacy choices and rights</li>
+              <li><strong>Marketing &amp; the Spam Act</strong></li>
+              <li>Cookies &amp; Google Analytics</li>
+              <li><strong>Third-party links</strong></li>
+              <li>How to contact us and make a complaint</li>
+            </ul>
+            <p>
+              “<strong>Personal information</strong>” has the meaning in the
+              <strong>Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)</strong>.
+            </p>
+
+            <h2 id="information-we-collect" class="font-heading text-2xl">
+              Information we collect
+            </h2>
+
+            <h3 class="font-medium">Information you provide</h3>
