+              </li>
+              <li>
+                <strong>Support emails:</strong> generally up to <strong>2 years</strong> after
+                resolution (or as needed for disputes).
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                <strong>Marketing records:</strong> until you <strong>unsubscribe</strong> (we keep
+                a minimal suppression record to honour the opt-out).
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                <strong>Analytics:</strong> Google Analytics data is currently set to
+                <strong>26 months</strong>.
+              </li>
+            </ul>
+            <p>When no longer needed, we delete or de-identify information.</p>
+
