+              Cookies &amp; Google Analytics
+            </h2>
+            <p>
+              We use cookies to run our site and <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to understand
+              aggregated usage (e.g., which pages are visited). Google Analytics uses
+              identifiers/cookies to generate reports for us; we do not receive information that
+              directly identifies you.
